# Deye SG06 RS485 Monitor — lab context

## Hardware (field-tested)

- **Deye 6 kW SG06** hybrid inverter — Modbus RTU **slave**, datalogger port.
- Battery pack **16S 51.2 V 100 Ah** with **JK-PB1A16S10P** linked to inverter over **CAN** (not Modbus).
- Gateway: Cytron **IRIV IOC MQTT Gateway** → MQTT broker `iriv-pi-control`, base topic `iriv/ivt`.
- Optional: ESPHome NodeMCU hostname `sg06-nodemcu`.

## Bus rules

- Baud **9600** 8N1, slave ID **1**, FC03/FC10.
- **One master per bus.** Do not run IRIV and ESPHome on the same A/B.
- Do not put a Modbus/CAN sniffer master on the Deye↔JK **CAN** cable for normal monitoring.

## IRIV job cap (firmware-dependent)

- IOC firmware **before V1.2.6**: enabling a **27th** `pollJob` caused device **reboot** and **all jobs wiped**. **V1.2.6** fixes that.
- Import on **≥ V1.2.6**: `iriv/iriv-ioc-config.json` — **27** enabled jobs, full PV2 (regs **111 / 112 / 187**), Load Current (179), Inverter Frequency (193).
- Older firmware: `iriv/iriv-ioc-config-26.json` — drops **PV2 Current** only.
- Device web login is `system.adminUser` / `adminPassHash` in the IRIV JSON (`admin`, hash exported for password `12345678`). Do not put that password in the browser dashboard. MQTT broker auth stays off unless the broker requires it.
- Regenerate only via `python iriv/_gen_iriv_jobs.py`. Keep `dataType: 3` (s16) for 16-bit Deye regs — `dataType: 1` produced bogus values ≈ scale.

## Field-verified register corrections

| Topic | Reg | Scale / note |
|-------|-----|----------------|
| Charge / Discharge today | **70 = charge**, **71 = discharge** | 0.1 kWh (PDF V118 was swapped vs SG06) |
| PV current | 110, 112 | **0.1** A (not 0.01) |
| Grid current | 160 | **0.01** A (×0.1 was 10× high vs Deye logger) |
| Load current | **179** | 0.01 A, s16 |
| Load power | 178 | 1 W |
| Inverter frequency | 193 | 0.01 Hz |
| Batt temp / Inv temp | 182, 91 | scale 0.1, offset **-100** |
| Poll periods | V/I/P | **1000 ms**; temp/SOC/Hz **10000**; `*_today` **30000** |

## Key paths

- `iriv/iriv-ioc-config.json` — import on firmware ≥ V1.2.6 (27 jobs, full PV2)
- `iriv/iriv-ioc-config-26.json` — older firmware only (no PV2 Current)
- `iriv/_gen_iriv_jobs.py`
- `emulator/deye-sg06-ivt-emu.py` + `emulator/rs485_emu/`
- `esphome/deye-sg06-nodemcu.yaml`
- `homeassistant/iriv_deye_mqtt.yaml`
- `web/` — MQTT WebSocket dashboard
- `docs/protocol/` — Deye Modbus PDF V118
- `docs/HANDOFF.md` — full narrative handoff
- `docs/esp32/README.md` — planned ESP32 UART→RS485 master (stub)

## Sister project

JK BMS Modbus monitor lives in `jk-pb-rs485-monitor` (115200 / slave 15 / UART1). Pylon-style BMS bench slave: `jk-pb-rs485-monitor/emulator/bms-pylon-emu.py`. Do not merge full Deye + JK IRIV job sets onto one gateway. Use separate RS485 buses. A 27th enabled job still wipes firmware older than V1.2.6.
